{"question_id": "06878be2", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Based on your current setup — Sony A7R IV, Sony 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, Godox V1 flash (decided), and the Gitzo GT3543LS tripod you're considering — here are complementary accessories:\n\n**For your Godox V1 flash:**\n- **Flash case/pouch**: A hard case like the Godox V1 Hard Case ($25) or a pouch like the Think Tank Photo Flash Pouch ($15) will protect your flash during transport.\n- **Battery pack**: For extended shoots, a power bank like the Anker PowerCore 20000 PD ($60) keeps you powered on location.\n\n**For your lens:**\n- **Safe cleaning supplies**: Given your concern about streaks/scratches, use a soft dry microfiber cloth, lens cleaning tissues, or pre-moistened wipes — wiping from the center outward in a circular motion. Avoid paper towels, household cleaners, and excessive pressure.\n\n**For the Gitzo GT3543LS tripod (if you get it):**\n- **Ballhead**: The Gitzo GH3382QD ballhead is a confirmed match, or any head with a 3/8\" thread.\n\n**For your camera bag upgrade:**\n- Brands like Think Tank Photo, Lowepro, F-Stop Gear, Peak Design, and MindShift Gear make Sony-compatible bags. If you can share your budget, gear capacity needs, style preference, and whether it's for travel or everyday use, I can narrow it down.\n\nWould you like me to dig deeper into any of these?", "n_records": 39, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2006, "completion_tokens": 874, "calls": 1}, "selected": ["self|camera_body", "self|flash_upgrade_interest", "self|flash_choice", "self|flash_purchase_decision", "self|lens", "self|lens_cleaning_concern", "self|tripod_interest", "self|camera_bag_upgrade", "self|camera_bag_research", "assistant|flash_recommendation", "assistant|godox_v1|flash_build_comparison", "assistant|sony_hvl_f60rm|flash_build_comparison", "assistant|flash_weather_sealing", "assistant|flash_battery_life", "assistant|flash_recycle_time", "assistant|flash_case_recommendation", "assistant|flash_po