{"question_id": "95228167", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Based on your situation (currently playing a Stratocaster, considering a Les Paul, with open D tuning and acoustic-style fingerpicking in mind), here's what to focus on:\n\n**Try both guitars before deciding.** You were advised to test out both the Stratocaster and Les Paul to see which one feels and sounds like \"home\" — that's the most important step.\n\n**Look for coil-tap/coil-split features.** Since you want extra tonal flexibility (especially in open D), the models to ask about are:\n- Gibson Les Paul Standard (coil-tap on the tone controls)\n- Gibson Les Paul Traditional (coil-splitting)\n- Gibson Les Paul Custom (often coil-tap or coil-split)\n\n**Test it for your actual playing styles, not just general impressions.** Keep in mind the Les Paul is better suited to rock, blues, hard rock, classic rock, metal, and southern rock than to delicate acoustic-style fingerpicking. Since you love \"Blackbird\"-style fingerpicking, try that in the store — use the neck pickup, a lighter touch, and see if the clean tone works for you (an acoustic simulator pedal is a fallback option if the electric tone alone doesn't satisfy you).\n\n**For open D specifically:** the neck pickup gives you a warmer, mellower tone, and heavier strings (0.012–0.052 or 0.013–0.056) will give a fuller, more resonant sound — though you can ask the store about string gauge options after purchase.\n\n**Comfort check:** pay attention to how the neck and weight feel in your hands during extended playing, since that's what will matter most once you get it home.", "n_records": 13, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1361, "completion_tokens": 851, "calls": 1}, "selected": ["self|current_guitar", "self|guitar_interest_open_d_tuning", "self|playing_interest_fingerpicking", "self|guitar_feature_preference", "assistant|guitar_purchase_advice", "assistant|open_d_setup_strings", "assistant|open_d_setup_guitar", "assistant|open_d_amp_settings", "assistant|open_d_pickup_advice", "assistant|open_d_technique_advice", "assistant|les_paul_coil_tap_models", "assistant|les_paul_fingerpicking_tips", "assistant|les_paul_genre_fit"], "digest_bytes": 2480}
